l Consolidated Financial Statements), which is incorporated by reference and not included in the supplied Form 40-F wrapper. The wrapper contains debt-related narrative (e.g., equipment loans, notes) but no total liabilities figure.\",\n\"checked_locations\": [\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"EXHIBIT INDEX, Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm) - incorporated by reference, exhibit content not present in supplied document\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"ITEM 12 - ADDITIONAL INFORMATION (a_036), which references the Annual Consolidated Financial Statements without presenting any balance sheet data\"\n}\n]\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity\",\n\"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n\"reason\": \"The consolidated primary balance sheet, including its balancing total of liabilities and stockholders' equity, is contained in Exhibit 99.2 (Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements), which is incorporated by reference and intentionally absent from this Form 40-F wrapper.\",\n\"checked_locations\": [\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"EXHIBIT INDEX, Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm) - incorporated by reference, exhibit content not present in supplied document\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50e