6\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"EXHIBIT INDEX, Exhibit 99.2 'Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025' (cni-20251231.htm) - incorporated by reference, exhibit content not present in supplied document\"\n},\n{\n\"accession\": \"0001104659-26-010352\",\n\"document\": \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\",\n\"locator\": \"Liquidity and capital resources incorporation clause (S:W:B135) referencing Exhibit 99.1 MD&A - no cash flow statement data presented in wrapper\"\n}\n]\n}\n]\n}","reasoning_content":"The task: Extract requested financial statement fields from the supplied official filing documents. The manifest says: \"Form 40-F wrapper only; incorporated Exhibit 99.2 is intentionally absent\". The requested fields are balance sheet items (AssetsCurrent, Assets, LiabilitiesCurrent, Liabilities, LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity), NetIncomeLoss, NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities — all from the consolidated primary financial statements for FY2025 (ended 2025-12-31).\n\nLooking at the document content: It's the Form 40-F wrapper (tm261145d1_40f.htm) containing the Annual Information Form, cover page, etc. The actual audited consolidated financial statements (Exhibit 99.2, cni-20251231.htm) are NOT included — the manifest explicitly says \"incorporated Exhibit 99.2 is intentionally absent\".\n\nSo none of the requested fields can be found in the supplied document. Each field should get a \"not_found\" outcome with checked_locations. The schema requires for not_found: requested_field, outcome, reason (max 400 chars), checked_locations (minItems 1).\n\nThe checked_locations should reference the document we checked — accession 0001104659-26-010352, document tm261145d1_40f.htm, document_sha256 7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f, locator — something like the exhibit index or the relevant sections.\n\nWait — the checked_location schema requires: accession, document, document_sha256, locator. All required. Note the checked_location differs from \"location\" — location requires table, row, column too, but checked_location only requires accession, document, document_sha256, locator.\n\nAlso note: some of the wrapper content does contain some financial data points (commercial paper borrowings, notes issued, dividends, auditor fees), but none of the requested fields (total current assets, total assets, total current liabilities, total liabilities, total liabilities and stockholders' equity, net income, net cash from operating activities) are reported on the primary statements — because the primary statements are not in the document at all.\n\nShould any be \"ambiguous\" or \"found\"? No — the balance sheet, income statement, and cash flow statement are all in Exhibit 99.2 which is absent. The wrapper only incorporates by reference. So all seven fields are not_found.\n\nLet me verify: The document mentions \"Item 12 ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\" referencing the Annual Consolidated Financial Statements; the exhibit index lists Exhibit 99.2 \"Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements for the year ended December 31, 2025*\" as a link (cni-20251231.htm), which is not part of the supplied documents.\n\nReasons: \"Exhibit 99.2 (audited consolidated financial statements) is incorporated by reference and not included in the provided filing; the Form 40-F wrapper contains no consolidated balance sheet, income statement, or cash flow statement.\"\n\nEach result needs its own not_found entry with at least one checked_location. I can use relevant locators:\n\n- For balance sheet items (AssetsCurrent, Assets, LiabilitiesCurrent, Liabilities, LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity): locator could be \"EXHIBIT INDEX - Exhibit 99.2 Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements (incorporated by reference, not present)\" and/or the Item 12 section.\n- For NetIncomeLoss: same.\n- For NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities: same.\n\nI could provide two checked locations each (minItems 1 for not_found; ambiguous needs minItems 2). For not_found minItems is 1. I'll include one or two locations.\n\nLocators: The document has anchor-like references like \"EXHIBIT INDEX\" (S:W:B1046), and Exhibit 99.2 links to cni-20251231.htm. Also Item 12 (a_036 / S:W:C45.1.1). Let me use descriptive locators:\n\n- \"EXHIBIT INDEX row for Exhibit 99.2 — Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements (cni-20251231.htm, incorporated by reference; exhibit content not included in supplied document)\"\n- \"ITEM 12 — ADDITIONAL INFORMATION (a_036), which references the Annual Consolidated Financial Statements without presenting them\"\n\nFor each field, I'll include both checked locations.\n\nOutput JSON:\n\n{\n  \"schema\": \"statement_candidate_v1\",\n  \"request_id\": \"pilot-cni-wrapper-neighbour-v1\",\n  \"results\": [ ... 7 not_found entries ... ]\n}\n\nEach result:\n{\n  \"requested_field\": \"AssetsCurrent\",\n  \"outcome\": \"not_found\",\n  \"reason\": \"...\",\n  \"checked_locations\": [...]\n}\n\nReasons (must be ≤400 chars, ≥1):\n\n- AssetsCurrent: \"The consolidated balance sheet is in Exhibit 99.2 (Audited Annual Consolidated Financial Statements), which is incorporated by reference and not included in the supplied Form 40-F wrapper. No total current assets figure appears anywhere in the wrapper text.\"\n\n- Assets: similar.\n- LiabilitiesCurrent, Liabilities, LiabilitiesAndStockholdersEquity: similar.\n- NetIncomeLoss: \"The primary income statement is in Exhibit 99.2... The wrapper mentions no consolidated net income figure for FY2025.\"\n- NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities: \"The consolidated statement of cash flows is in Exhibit 99.2... wrapper contains no operating cash flow figure.\"\n\nEnsure the JSON matches the schema exactly: not_found requires requested_field, outcome, reason, checked_locations. checked_location requires accession, document, document_sha256, locator. additionalProperties false — so no extra fields.\n\ndocument_sha256: \"7490bb0e34394e55e1e349e7f3c44581fe3bfe50ee02b368a1c4b938af13ab2f\" — matches pattern.\n\naccession: \"0001104659-26-010352\".\n\ndocument: \"tm261145d1_40f.htm\".\n\nNow write reasons carefully, under 400 chars.\n\nDouble-check: any possibility that the wrapper contains any of the requested totals? Scanning... dividends table, auditor fees table, notes offering details, commercial paper amounts, borrowings of $1,329 million equipment loans. None of the requested totals. Correct — all not_found.\n\nI'll produce the JSON only (or minimal surrounding). The instruction: \"Return JSON matching the supplied schema.\" I'll return just the JSON.","tools":null},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":32021,"total_tokens":35923,"completion_tokens":3902,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1401},"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1401}}}